msgctxt "132"
msgid "Gah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Huh? That was my pension check, you thief! Catch him! Catch hiiim!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Got it! You wait right there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "You're better off calling the police, ma'am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Oh, well... As it happens, it's possible the purse-snatcher was... my "
"grandson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"Lately he's taken up with a rough crowd, and he keeps comin' by to squeeze "
"me for pocket money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "If I tell the police, they'll throw him in jail... and I can't have that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Still, you have to admit this has gotten out of hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"I can't disagree with you there. I'll have a talk with him later, but I'm "
"not sure I can do much more than that... I hope you understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Anyway, he's probably hidin' over behind the ice cream shop again. I'll go "
"give him a piece of my mind."
msgstr ""

